    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it’s not a shared journey when they’re the ones doing all the heavy lifting. i see it in their eyes every night, just how tired they are of managing my moods. it’s like i’m robbing them of their own lives just to keep me going. if i wasn't here, they could actually breathe for once. wouldn't they be better off if they could just move on without having to constantly worry about if i'm okay or not?",
